   "text": "University of Cumbria International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Cumbria International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Cumbria International College offers specialist tuition in English language, study skills and subject preparation. You’ll study programmes developed in collaboration with the University of Cumbria in preparation for your university degree.\nYou will learn in a supportive environment, in small class sizes with other international students from all over the world. With regular personal tutorial sessions, supplementary classes, and a timetable designed to maximise your ability to learn, you will be assisted to reach your full potential by our experienced staff.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 07:01\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 07:01\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £15,950.00\nMin: £14,950.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n3%\n150 of 4,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nMalvern International PLC\nFounded Year\n2007\nCampus(es)\nLancaster\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBangladesh, India, Sri Lanka, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n10/04/2026\nContract End Date\n10/04/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lJNfxcYD5eA\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
